WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:00.680
She's gone.

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:02.690
She's coming back. I am almost positive.

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:03.290
Almost!?

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.100
Why do I listen to you? Why? You were wrong
about the iPod being a failure. You were

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.760
wrong about tomato being a vegetable. I don't
even want to talk about your favorite planet,

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.140
Pluto.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.990
And unless she was lying to the good
ladies of The View, it's Demi.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:15.710
Not Demi!

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.710
You were going to let me go with him!?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.050
Isn't that what you wanted, honey?

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:24.560
What's the matter with you? You've been acting so weird
ever since I left college.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.810
For the record, you didn't leave college. You
were asked to leave.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.710
Oh, which you guys never let me forget.
Especially Dad.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.330
Honey, your father-

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.700
Oh, you don't have to tell me what he thinks, okay?

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.670
I'm a huge disappointment to him. I see it on his
face every day.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.680
He acts as if he doesn't even want me around.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.040
Give me the ticket for the car.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.180
Phil-

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.170
I'm going after her.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:44.870
This little chicken game may work for your dad,
but it doesn't work for me.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:45.950
That's my little girl.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.050
I need her to know that no guy on earth is good
enough for her,

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:50.720
Let alone some slimy, middle-aged jean salesman.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.410
What's this?

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.160
Just enjoy it.

